OL,3,GNEWSAStar takes centre stage after
OL,4,AStrictly departure
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the longest-serving female
OL,7,Fprofessional performers on Strictly
OL,8,FCome Dancing has turned to theatre
OL,9,Ffollowing her departure from the BBC
OL,10,Fprogramme.
OL,12,FKaren Hauer has joined Eastbourne
OL,13,FDevonshire Park Theatre's new
OL,14,Fproduction of Richard Harris's comedy,
OL,15,FStepping Out.
OL,17,FThe story follows a group of amateur
OL,18,Fdancers attending a weekly tap class
OL,19,Fand explores themes of friendship,
OL,20,Fconfidence and belonging.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
