OL,3,GNEWSAStar takes centre stage after
OL,4,AStrictly departure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Venezuelan-American told BBC Radio
OL,7,FSussex she had been "loving her time in
OL,8,FEastbourne", praising the town for its
OL,9,Fcoffee shops and saunas.
